<section class="card"><h2>AI Ads subscription</h2><p class="sub">AI copy suggestions require paid access. Connecting Meta and saving drafts are free.</p><div class="notice"><?= !empty($has_ads_access)?'Subscription active through '.html_escape($subscription['expires_at']??''):'No verified subscription is active.'; ?> Access activates after Next Admin verifies payment. Renewal is manual; automatic charging is not enabled.</div><?php foreach(array('monthly'=>'Monthly access','annual'=>'Annual access') as $period=>$label): ?><form method="post" action="<?= base_url('marketing/ai_ads/subscribe'); ?>" style="margin:8px 0"><input type="hidden" name="<?= html_escape($csrfName); ?>" value="<?= html_escape($csrfHash); ?>"><input type="hidden" name="billing_period" value="<?= html_escape($period); ?>"><button class="btn" type="submit"><?= html_escape($label); ?></button></form><?php endforeach; ?><p class="muted">Next Admin will show the configured invoice price. Meta bills advertising spend directly to your account. MartPoint does not publish ads yet. Once publishing is released, campaigns stay in Meta until their own end date or until you pause them.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Prepare an ad draft</h2><p class="sub">Saved drafts are not published and do not spend money.</p><div class="notice">AI can suggest ad text when MartPoint Assist AI is enabled. You must review suggestions before saving.</div><form id="aiads-copy-form" method="post" action="<?= base_url('marketing/ai_ads/save_draft?screen=mobile'); ?>"><input type="hidden" name="<?= html_escape($csrfName); ?>" value="<?= html_escape($csrfHash); ?>"><input type="hidden" name="request_key" value="<?= bin2hex(random_bytes(20)); ?>"><label class="field">What do you want to advertise?<textarea id="aiads-prompt" name="prompt" rows="3" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Promote my skincare products in Lekki and get WhatsApp enquiries"></textarea></label><button class="btn" id="aiads-generate" type="button">Suggest headline and text</button> <span id="aiads-copy-status" class="muted" aria-live="polite"></span><label class="field">Choose a product (optional)</label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="product_id" value="0" checked><span>No product selected</span></label><?php foreach($products as $product): ?><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="product_id" value="<?= (int)$product['id']; ?>"><span><?= html_escape($product['item_name']); ?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?><label class="field">Location<input name="location_text" maxlength="190" placeholder="Lekki, Lagos"></label><label class="field">Daily budget (₦)<input type="number" name="daily_budget" min="0" max="100000000" step="500" placeholder="3000"></label><label class="field">Duration in days<input type="number" name="duration_days" min="1" max="365" value="30" required></label><label class="field">Headline<input id="aiads-headline" name="headline" maxlength="255" required></label><label class="field">Ad text<textarea id="aiads-body" name="body" rows="4" maxlength="5000" required></textarea></label><label class="field">Destination URL (optional)<input type="url" name="destination_url" placeholder="https://..."></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Save draft</button></form></section>
